Package: skrivro
Version: @VERSION@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Joseph R. Prostko <joe.prostko@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jprostko/skrivro
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0t64 | libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libsoup-3.0-0t64 | libsoup-3.0-0, libcairo2, libdbus-1-3, libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Keyboard-first AsciiDoc and Markdown editor with live preview
 A keyboard-first editor for AsciiDoc and Markdown with a live side-by-side
 preview. Documents render as you type, with three display modes: editor
 only, split, or preview only. Vim emulation is available as a first-class
 option, and the interface stays minimal, a single status bar and no
 toolbars. It runs offline and makes no network requests of its own.
